        "original_id": "6675eb59-d4be-5824-8219-af9d6e8cf5cc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Irvine Welsh, Terry Lawson\n- Works: A Decent Ride, Glue, Porno, Trainspotting\n- Events: Scottish Hurricane Bawbag\n- Topics: publication chronology, character continuity\n\nFacts:\n- Irvine Welsh published the novel \"Porno\" in 2002.\n- \"Porno\" is the sequel to \"Trainspotting\".\n- Terry Lawson was first introduced in Irvine Welsh's \"Glue\".\n- Irvine Welsh later returned to the character Terry Lawson in \"A Decent Ride\".\n- \"A Decent Ride\" takes place 10 years after the events of \"Porno\".\n- \"A Decent Ride\" is set during the 2011 Scottish Hurricane Bawbag.",
